#: telescope/platform/__init__.py:217
msgid "The Telescope app on the phone was signed differently. Uninstall it on the phone, then try again."
msgstr "फ़ोन पर Telescope ऐप अलग तरह से साइन किया गया था. फ़ोन पर इसे अनइंस्टॉल करें, फिर कोशिश करें."

#: telescope/platform/__init__.py:220
msgid "The phone already has a newer Telescope app."
msgstr "फ़ोन पर पहले से नया Telescope ऐप है."

#: telescope/platform/__init__.py:221
msgid "adb install failed"
msgstr "adb install विफल रहा"

#: telescope/platform/adb_download.py:146
msgid "Finding the current adb…"
msgstr "मौजूदा adb खोजा जा रहा है…"

#: telescope/platform/adb_download.py:154
msgid "Google's list of downloads wasn't what Telescope expected. Try again later."
msgstr "Google की डाउनलोड सूची वैसी नहीं थी जैसी Telescope को उम्मीद थी. बाद में फिर कोशिश करें."

#: telescope/platform/adb_download.py:160
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Downloading adb {version} from Google…"
msgstr "Google से adb {version} डाउनलोड हो रहा है…"

#: telescope/platform/adb_download.py:161
msgid "Downloading adb from Google…"
msgstr "Google से adb डाउनलोड हो रहा है…"

#: telescope/platform/adb_download.py:167 telescope/widgets/adb.py:81
msgid "Couldn't download adb. Try again."
msgstr "adb डाउनलोड नहीं किया जा सका. फिर कोशिश करें."

#: telescope/platform/adb_download.py:169
msgid "The download didn't match Google's checksum, so it wasn't used. Try again."
msgstr "डाउनलोड Google के चेकसम से मेल नहीं खाया, इसलिए इसका उपयोग नहीं हुआ. फिर कोशिश करें."

#: telescope/platform/adb_download.py:170
msgid "Unpacking…"
msgstr "अनपैक किया जा रहा है…"

#: telescope/platform/adb_download.py:176
msgid "Couldn't unpack adb. Try again."
msgstr "adb अनपैक नहीं किया जा सका. फिर कोशिश करें."

#: telescope/platform/adb_download.py:178
msgid "Google's download doesn't have adb.exe in it anymore."
msgstr "Google के डाउनलोड में अब adb.exe नहीं है."

#: telescope/platform/adb_download.py:209
msgid "Couldn't put adb in place. Is another program using it? Try again."
msgstr "adb को सही जगह नहीं रखा जा सका. क्या कोई दूसरा प्रोग्राम इसे इस्तेमाल कर रहा है? फिर कोशिश करें."

#: telescope/platform/adb_download.py:233
msgid "Couldn't copy adb from there."
msgstr "वहां से adb कॉपी नहीं किया जा सका."

#: telescope/platform/adb_download.py:235
msgid "That doesn't have adb.exe in it."
msgstr "उसमें adb.exe नहीं है."

#: telescope/platform/adb_download.py:245
msgid "Couldn't check Google's certificate, so nothing was downloaded. Security software or a network that inspects HTTPS can cause this."
